      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "The policies you set with this function replace any already in the trust management object.",
      "contextAfter": "For example, you cannot call this function on one thread at the same time as you are calling the [`SecTrustEvaluateWithError(_:_:)`](sectrustevaluatewitherror(_:_:).md) function for the same trust management object on another thread, but you can call this function and simultaneously evaluate a different trust management object on another thread.",
